                                "sense_id": "3bd6cd43-a65c-3a4f-bfe1-6e1c637bf81c",
                                "text": "There is nothing more derided than the raptures of a young affection."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "277e6aa4-1658-4d2a-b165-59ec8bbae99c",
                                "sense_id": "3bd6cd43-a65c-3a4f-bfe1-6e1c637bf81c",
                                "text": "Moreover, the legacy of anti-Asian racism has meant that even relatively modest efforts on foreign policy have been, as Paul Watanabe notes, \"more discouraged than encouraged, more derided than applauded.\""
                            }
                        ]
